2783     SECTION 4: Domain assignment with rationales, g.var_domain_map, guards,
2784                and the Checkpoint 1 crosswalk export
2785     -------------------------------------------------------------------------
2786     Lookup keyed on upcased varname. The quotes that previously wrapped each
2787     rationale have been removed: INFILE DSD does not strip single quotes, so
2788     they were being stored literally and exported into the review CSV. They
2789     were never needed -- DATALINES does not resolve macro triggers, and no
2790     rationale contains a comma.
2791  
2792     assign_rule for frailty is 'timing', not 'instrument'. The locked rule
2793     defines instrument membership as the override to D3 for named COGNITIVE
2794     instruments. Tagging frailty the same way would mix the two in the QC
2795     sheet's per-rule counts.
